    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Chess Pattern is a tool for creating visual elements in the form of a grid, or, figuratively, a honeycomb. Element shapes range from diamonds to circles. Basic properties can be customized (grid presence, line thickness, empty cells, empty cell size, border radius of elements, number of columns, cell spacing, and a set of five preset and customizable color presets (linear gradient)). Individual settings (when adding an element) include choosing a color from a preset, inserting an image, and adding text. You can also add a custom class.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the plugin files to the <code>/wp-content/plugins/chess-pattern</code> directory.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; screen in WordPress.</li>\n<li>Use the Gutenberg editor to add the &#8216;Chess Gallery&#8217; block to your page.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>All images used in the block preview are licensed under Creative Commons Zero (CC0) or created by the author.</p>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "A professional interactive honeycomb and chess-style gallery grid for the Gutenberg editor. Perfect for portfolios and creative image displays.",
    "description": "<p>Chess Pattern is a tool for creating visual elements in the form of a grid, or, figuratively, a honeycomb. Element shapes range from diamonds to circles. Basic properties can be customized (grid presence, line thickness, empty cells, empty cell size, border radius of elements, number of columns, cell spacing, and a set of five preset and customizable color presets (linear gradient)). Individual settings (when adding an element) include choosing a color from a preset, inserting an image, and adding text. You can also add a custom class.</p>\n",
